{
  "name": "ReadIntoIsADict",
  "comment": "A format type owns its parse (ruling 5): the first read into a json file parses it\ninto a plang dict. The read goes first (decision 401 — json stays text until read into),\nthen `%cfg% is dict` is true. Today's parse yields a C# JsonElement, so `is dict` reads\nfalse even after a successful member read (Cut2 / Narrow baseline).",
  "step": [
